EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

If you are unable to obtain your immigration documents in time, Arizona State University allows you to defer your admission for only one semester. If you defer your admission, you will be allowed to enroll in the next consecutive semester. If you do not enroll in the next semester, you will have to reapply to ASU.

If you choose to defer your admission, please complete the attached form and email the deferment information to DeferUGAdmissions@asu.edu.

Please note that you will need to submit your immigration supporting documents.

If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
